'''Naval Station Arayamar''' ({{lang-bl|Estacion naval Arayamar}}) is a [[Confederal Navy]] base in [[Alessandria]], [[Hesperia]], that is the headquarters and [[W:Home port|home port]] of the Confederal Navy's [[Aethiopian Maritime Command]]. The installation occupies about {{Convert|3.8|km2|sqmi}} of pier and wharf space of the [[Port of Alessandria]], located on the peninsula of [[Venetian Point, Alessandria|Venetian Point]]. It is Balisca's largest [[W:Naval base|naval base]].

The base is the home port for roughly one-fourth of the Baliscan Navy's surface fleet, the largest concentration of Baliscan naval forces through 42 ships alongside 14 piers, and employs up to 30,000 people. The base is also home to a number of commercial shore activities (including a ship repair facility operated by [[Astilleros Baliscanos]]); naval logistics, accommodation and messing; and personnel support functions (e.g. medical and dental; education; pastoral and welfare) provided by Defense Equipment and Support.

